---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Distressed Asset Funds | Platizio Alternatives" currentPage="products/funds/distressed">

<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 py-8">
  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-secondary mb-8 pt-4 flex-wrap">
    <a href="/knowledge/aif" class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-label hover:text-primary-container transition-colors">AIF Knowledge</a>
    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[12px]">chevron_right</span>
    <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-label text-secondary">Cat II AIF</span>
    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[12px]">chevron_right</span>
    <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-label text-on-surface">Distressed Asset Funds</span>
  </div>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="mb-16">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
      <span class="bg-secondary/10 text-secondary text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-3 py-1">Category II AIF</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="font-headline text-5xl md:text-6xl font-light leading-tight text-primary-container mb-4">
      Distressed Asset <span class="italic">Funds</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed text-lg max-w-2xl">
      Acquiring undervalued assets at steep discounts to intrinsic value, engineering operational turnarounds, and extracting outsized returns from complexity, distress, and mispriced risk.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Definition -->
  <section class="mb-16">
    <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-8 md:p-10">
      <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl mb-6 text-primary-container">Definition & Purpose</h2>
      <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-8">
        Distressed Asset Funds operate under Category II AIF registration and focus on acquiring debt, equity, or assets of companies undergoing financial stress, insolvency proceedings, or operational restructuring. The investment thesis is predicated on mispricing created by forced selling, regulatory complexity, or information asymmetry. India's Insolvency and Bankruptcy Code (IBC) has created a structured resolution ecosystem that these funds navigate with specialized legal and operational expertise.
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-4">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mb-2 block">construction</span>
          <h4 class="text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary mb-1">Focus</h4>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Turnaround/Restructuring</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-4">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mb-2 block">monitoring</span>
          <h4 class="text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary mb-1">Risk Profile</h4>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold">High</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-4">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mb-2 block">payments</span>
          <h4 class="text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary mb-1">Min. Investment</h4>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold">&#8377;1 Crore</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-4">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mb-2 block">schedule</span>
          <h4 class="text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary mb-1">Tenure</h4>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold">5&ndash;7 Years</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Key Characteristics -->
  <section class="mb-16">
    <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl mb-10 text-primary-container pl-4 border-l-2 border-tertiary-fixed">
      Key <span class="italic">Characteristics</span>
    </h2>
    <div class="space-y-8">
      <div class="flex gap-6 items-start">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center bg-primary-container text-tertiary-fixed">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined">sell</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-xl mb-2">Discounted Acquisition</h3>
          <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">The core return driver is acquisition of stressed assets &mdash; NPAs, distressed bonds, or pledged physical assets &mdash; at 40&ndash;70 paise on the rupee. Entry at meaningful discounts to intrinsic value creates a margin of safety while compounding returns when full value is unlocked through restructuring.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-6 items-start ml-4">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center bg-secondary text-surface">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined">autorenew</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-xl mb-2">NCLT/IBC Processes</h3>
          <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">India's Insolvency and Bankruptcy Code provides a statutory framework for resolution that distressed asset managers leverage with dedicated legal teams. Managers with established NCLT practice navigate the resolution professional process and submit credible resolution plans to acquire enterprises with cleared liabilities.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-6 items-start">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center bg-primary-container text-tertiary-fixed">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined">gavel</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-xl mb-2">Value Recovery</h3>
          <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Post-acquisition restructuring encompasses balance sheet deleveraging, management reconstitution, supply chain renegotiation, and non-core asset monetization. Value creation is active and operational rather than passive and market-dependent, requiring deep operational expertise alongside financial acumen.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Lifecycle -->
  <section class="mb-16 bg-primary-container text-surface p-8 md:p-12 overflow-hidden relative">
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-secondary/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl mb-12 text-tertiary-fixed relative z-10">The Distressed Fund <span class="italic">Lifecycle</span></h2>
    <div class="relative z-10">
      <div class="absolute left-3 top-0 bottom-0 w-[1px] bg-secondary"></div>
      <div class="mb-10 pl-10 relative">
        <div class="absolute left-0 top-1.5 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-tertiary-fixed border-4 border-primary-container"></div>
        <h4 class="font-label text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-secondary mb-1">Phase 01</h4>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl mb-2">Acquisition at Discount</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-surface-variant opacity-80 leading-relaxed">Opportunities identified through NPA databases, NCLT filings, bank auction notices, and proprietary credit surveillance systems. Legal diligence maps encumbrances, pending litigation, and priority of claim before acquisition is structured.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mb-10 pl-10 relative">
        <div class="absolute left-0 top-1.5 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-secondary border-4 border-primary-container"></div>
        <h4 class="font-label text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-secondary mb-1">Phase 02</h4>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl mb-2">Restructuring</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-surface-variant opacity-80 leading-relaxed">The fund's operating team implements the resolution plan &mdash; refinancing senior obligations, divesting non-core assets, replacing management where necessary, and renegotiating commercial contracts. Progress is measured against recovery milestones.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pl-10 relative">
        <div class="absolute left-0 top-1.5 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-secondary border-4 border-primary-container"></div>
        <h4 class="font-label text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-secondary mb-1">Phase 03</h4>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl mb-2">Resolution & Exit</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-surface-variant opacity-80 leading-relaxed">Exits pursued through strategic sale of the restructured entity, refinancing into conventional lending markets, or listing via IPO. Partial monetizations through asset sales provide interim distributions. Total return measured as MOIC net of restructuring costs and legal fees.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Benchmarks -->
  <section class="mb-16">
    <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl mb-8 text-primary-container">Institutional <span class="italic">Benchmarks</span></h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 border border-outline-variant/20">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-6">
          <div class="bg-primary-container p-3">
            <span class="text-tertiary-fixed font-headline text-2xl font-bold">K</span>
          </div>
          <span class="font-label text-[10px] bg-surface-container-high px-2 py-1 uppercase">Special Situations</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl mb-2">Kotak Special Situations Fund</h3>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed">Kotak's special situations platform is among India's most active participants in IBC proceedings and stressed asset auctions, leveraging the group's banking relationships for proprietary deal flow and a dedicated legal practice focused on insolvency resolution.</p>
        <div class="flex gap-4 items-center pt-4 border-t border-surface-container-low">
          <div>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-secondary uppercase font-label">Key Focus</p>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold">IBC, NPAs, Stressed Assets</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 border border-outline-variant/20">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-6">
          <div class="bg-secondary p-3">
            <span class="text-surface font-headline text-2xl font-bold">A</span>
          </div>
          <span class="font-label text-[10px] bg-surface-container-high px-2 py-1 uppercase">NPA Resolution</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl mb-2">Asset Reconstruction Companies</h3>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed">SEBI-registered ARCs such as ARCIL acquire non-performing assets from banks at agreed settlement values, managing recovery through restructuring, enforcement, and liquidation. Investors access diversified NPA pools through Security Receipts with defined recovery waterfall structures.</p>
        <div class="flex gap-4 items-center pt-4 border-t border-surface-container-low">
          <div>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-secondary uppercase font-label">Key Focus</p>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold">NPA Pools, SARFAESI, DRT</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <div class="bg-surface-container p-8 text-center border border-outline-variant/10">
    <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl mb-4">Access Distressed Asset Intelligence</h3>
    <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm mb-8">Connect with our special situations specialists to review current resolution opportunities and fund structures.</p>
    <a href="/partner" class="inline-block py-4 px-10 bg-primary-container text-on-primary font-label text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors">
      Request Fund Prospectus
    </a>
  </div>
</div>

</BaseLayout>
